<title>GERMANY: Fresenius sets one-for-nine rights issue.</title>
<headline>Fresenius sets one-for-nine rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>German medical firm Fresenius AG said on Tuesday it was making a one-for- nine rights issue at 320 marks per nominal five-mark share.</p>
<p>The firm said in an announcement that the offer would apply to holders of both ordinary and preference shares and would boost nominal share capital by 10 million marks to 100 million.</p>
<p>Fresenius closed down nine marks in Frankfurt on Tuesday at 382 marks.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, +49-228-26097150</p>
